/*
 * Implements semantic validation for calling prototype functions
 * (PrototypeValue) in Ymir.
 *
 * Responsibilities:
 *   - Reorder arguments according to named parameters.
 *   - Validate argument count and variadic behavior.
 *   - Infer and validate argument types using CallParamListCreation.
 *   - Perform memory-ownership verification for arguments.
 *   - Compute overload-resolution scoring contributions.
 *   - Construct a PrototypeCallValue representing the call.
 *   - Enforce unsafe-context restrictions for unsafe prototypes.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::call::proto
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/call/proto.yr
